title: 주5_금_1교시_정문_신아산_영문
---
{name()}: *Huff... puff...*
(I feel this every time I come to school, but the location of the Engineering Building is absolutely brutal.)
(How can it be at the very top of the mountain..?)
<<show san_smile>>
ASan: Bong-won, come here~.
ASan: Bong-won!!!
<<play 공통_야옹>>
(Despite ASan's desperate calls, Bong-won leaves without even a backward glance.)
<<play san_sound>>
<<show san_neg>>
ASan: He plays so well with the other kids. I guess Bong-won just hates me...
<<choice 주5_금_1교시_정문_신아산_긍정1_영문 "Maybe he likes you a bit less than the others?" 주5_금_1교시_정문_신아산_부정1_영문 "No way.">>
ASan: Do you really think so too?
===

title: 주5_금_1교시_정문_신아산_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Maybe he likes you a bit less than the others?
<<change lvSan -10>>
<<dislike 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
<<show san_shock>>
ASan: Excuse me?
{name()}: Huh..? 
{name()}: Oh, I'm not insulting you! It's just that he seems to cuddle with NaHyun or EunPyo more often!!!!!
ASan: ...........
(Uh oh. This is bad.)
(ASan looks like she's in a bad mood.)
{name()}: Ah, well, I think it's because those two always carry Churu treats with them.
{name()}: Bong-won is a total foodie, you know?
ASan: ...I should start carrying those from now on.
(ASan looks pretty discouraged.)
<<choice 주5_금_1교시_정문_신아산_긍정2_영문 "Should we go buy some Churu and feed Bong-won together?" 주5_금_1교시_정문_신아산_부정2_영문 "Wait, I left my wallet at home....">>
(Should I buy some Churu at the convenience store and feed Bong-won with her?)
===

title: 주5_금_1교시_정문_신아산_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: No way.
{name()}: It's not like that. In my opinion, Bong-won is just...
(I quietly and carefully reach my hand out toward Bong-won.)
<<wait 1>>
<<play 공통_야옹>>
<<show san_smile>>
ASan: Whoa!
ASan: Bong-won actually walked up to you on his own...
{name()}: See? If you just reach out quietly, he comes to you.
{name()}: Why would Bong-won ever hate you? Don't be silly.
<<show san_blush>>
<<change lvSan 10>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Well, I guess I *am* pretty likable, right?
ASan: I'll try it that way next time I see him!
ASan: Thanks for the tip.
(ASan and I spent some time chatting while petting Bong-won.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주5_금_1교시_정문_신아산_긍정2_영문
---
{name()}: Should we go buy some Churu and feed Bong-won together?
<<show san_smile>>
ASan: Should we?
<<if get("gold") >= 30>>
    <<jump 주5_금_1교시_정문_신아산_츄르o_영문>>
<<else>>
