<<endif>>
===

title: 주5_금_1교시_정문_신아산_부정2_영문
---
(Wait, I left my wallet at home....)
(.... What should I do....)
{name()}: Let's try that next time we see him.
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: Yeah, I guess that's best...
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: I should get going now.
ASan: See you later.
<<end>>
===

title: 주5_금_1교시_정문_신아산_츄르o_영문
---
{name()}: Yeah, let's go get some together.
<<play 공통_발소리>>
<<wait 2>>
<<change gold -30>>
<<show san_smile>>
<<change lvSan 15>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Alright, now that we've got the Churu, let's see if Bong-won likes it!
(She looks hilarious holding the Churu up high with a big grin.)
{name()}: Pfft, you're so simple.
<<show san_neg>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: Hey, was that an insult?
{name()}: No, no.
{name()}: I meant you're cute.
<<show san_blush>>
ASan: ...........
ASan: ..............
ASan: Wh-whatever!
ASan: Let's just go feed Bong-won!
<<play 공통_야옹>>
(And so, ASan and I fed Bong-won together.)
(I thought to myself that her blushing side profile as she fed him was actually pretty cute...)
<<end>>
===

title: 주5_금_1교시_정문_신아산_츄르x_영문
---
{name()}: .......?
ASan: What's wrong?
{name()}: I left my wallet at home....
<<show san_neg2>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: You WHAT?????????
ASan: Fine, I'll just go by myself.
<<change lvSan -5>>
<<dislike 신아산>>
{name()}: Wa-wait up!!!!!!
(Turning away coldly, ASan ran toward the convenience store faster than anyone.)
<<notice "You feel a pang of guilt.">>
<<change karma +1>>
(......I should've brought my wallet......)
<<end>>
===